{"id": "EUVD-2026-98951", "enisaUuid": "23ac42a8-a309-35a1-88b8-a35170cc2f60", "description": "Yshopmall through 2.0.0 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability in the after-sales API that allows authenticated members to access other members' data by supplying their after-sales id and orderCode. Attackers can call deleteAfterSalesOrder, addLogisticsInformation, or GET /applyForAfterSales/{key} to view other members' order items and tamper with or delete their after-sales records.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:16", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:58:48", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/yshopmall-member-api-ownership-idor", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshopmall/blob/d1b20a2d76dfd98985410116db3aca8aca193b26/yshop-mall-boot/yshop-app/src/main/java/co/yixiang/sales/rest/StoreAfterSalesController.java#L151-L187", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshopmall/blob/d1b20a2d76dfd98985410116db3aca8aca193b26/yshop-mall-boot/yshop-mall/src/main/java/co/yixiang/modules/sales/service/impl/StoreAfterSalesServiceImpl.java#L353-L383", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/yshopmall-through-2.0.0-idor-via-after-sales-api-in-storeaftersalescontroller"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110120", "GHSA-q3pp-r67w-8848"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5626800a-7956-3778-8776-3515d003e908", "product": {"name": "yshopmall", "vendor": {"name": "guchengwuyue"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f4701eb0-71af-326d-89d7-1b42509dc684", "vendor": {"name": "guchengwuyue"}}], "isExploited": false}